<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>たのしい！アルファベット音声クイズ</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Andika:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400;1,700&family=Comic+Neue:wght@700&family=M+PLUS+Rounded+1c:wght@700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        alphabet: ['Andika', 'Comic Neue', '"UD デジタル教科書体 N-R"', '"UD Digi Kyokasho N-R"', 'YuKyokasho', 'sans-serif'],
                        rounded: ['"M PLUS Rounded 1c"', 'sans-serif'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        popYellow: '#FFD166',
                        popPink: '#FF6B6B',
                        popGreen: '#06D6A0',
                        popBlue: '#118AB2',
                        popDarkBlue: '#073B4C',
                        popPurple: '#9D4EDD'
                    },
                    keyframes: {
                        popIn: {
                            '0%': { transform: 'scale(0.8)', opacity: '0' },
                            '100%': { transform: 'scale(1)', opacity: '1' },
                        },
                        shake: {
                            '0%, 100%': { transform: 'translateX(0)' },
                            '20%, 60%': { transform: 'translateX(-10px)' },
                            '40%, 80%': { transform: 'translateX(10px)' },
                        },
                        pulseGlow: {
                            '0%, 100%': { boxShadow: '0 0 15px rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.6)' },
                            '50%': { boxShadow: '0 0 30px rgba(255, 209, 102, 1)' }
                        }
                    },
                    animation: {
                        popIn: 'popIn 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275) forwards',
                        shake: 'shake 0.4s ease-in-out',
                        pulseGlow: 'pulseGlow 1.5s infinite ease-in-out'
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'M PLUS Rounded 1c', 'Andika', sans-serif;
            user-select: none;
            -webkit-user-select: none;
        }
        .alphabet-text {
            font-family: 'Andika', 'Comic Neue', 'UD デジタル教科書体 N-R', 'YuKyokasho', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .card-shadow {
            box-shadow: 0 10px 0 0 rgba(7, 59, 76, 0.2);
        }
        .card-shadow:active {
            box-shadow: 0 2px 0 0 rgba(7, 59, 76, 0.2);
            transform: translateY(8px);
        }
        .btn-push {
            transition: all 0.1s ease;
        }
        .btn-push:active {
            transform: translateY(4px);
        }
        ruby rt {
            font-size: 0.55em;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1;
            color: inherit;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gradient-to-b from-sky-300 via-indigo-200 to-pink-200 min-h-screen text-popDarkBlue flex flex-col justify-between overflow-x-hidden">

    <header class="p-4 md:p-6 flex justify-between items-center max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="bg-popYellow p-3 rounded-2xl border-4 border-popDarkBlue shadow-md flex items-center justify-center transform -rotate-6">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-icons text-3xl text-popDarkBlue"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black tracking-wide text-white drop-shadow-[0_3px_0_#073B4C] flex items-center gap-2">
                    アルファベット<span class="text-popYellow">クイズ</span>
                </h1>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Score, Streak & Timer Badge -->
        <div id="status-badges" class="hidden flex flex-wrap items-center justify-end gap-2 md:gap-3">
            <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur border-3 border-popDarkBlue px-3 py-1.5 md:px-4 md:py-2 rounded-2xl shadow-md flex items-center gap-2">
                <i id="timer-icon" class="fa-solid fa-clock text-popBlue text-lg md:text-2xl"></i>
                <span id="timer-display" class="font-alphabet text-lg md:text-2xl font-bold text-popDarkBlue">03:00</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur border-3 border-popDarkBlue px-3 py-1.5 md:px-4 md:py-2 rounded-2xl shadow-md flex items-center gap-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-star text-popYellow text-lg md:text-2xl"></i>
                <span id="score-display" class="font-alphabet text-lg md:text-2xl font-bold text-popDarkBlue">0</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur border-3 border-popDarkBlue px-3 py-1.5 md:px-4 md:py-2 rounded-2xl shadow-md flex items-center gap-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-fire text-popPink text-lg md:text-2xl"></i>
                <span id="streak-display" class="font-alphabet text-lg md:text-2xl font-bold text-popPink">0</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full">
        
        <div id="start-screen" class="w-full max-w-2xl bg-white/90 backdrop-blur border-4 border-popDarkBlue rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl flex flex-col items-center gap-6 my-auto animate-popIn">

            <!-- Total Points Display -->
            <div class="w-full text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 via-yellow-100 to-amber-50 border-3 border-popDarkBlue rounded-2xl p-3 shadow-sm">
                <div class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-popDarkBlue flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-crown text-popYellow text-lg md:text-xl drop-shadow-[0_1px_0_#073B4C]"></i>
                    <span><ruby>累計<rt>るいけい</rt></ruby><ruby>獲得<rt>かくとく</rt></ruby>ポイント</span>
                </div>
                <div class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-popPink font-alphabet mt-1 tracking-wider drop-shadow-sm" id="total-points-display">
                    0 <span class="text-base md:text-xl text-popDarkBlue font-bold">pt</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="w-full flex flex-col gap-5">
                <!-- Mode Select -->
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-popDarkBlue mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad mr-1 text-popBlue"></i> <ruby>遊<rt>あそ</rt></ruby>びかた</label>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 bg-sky-100/70 p-1.5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-popDarkBlue">
                        <button id="mode-4choice" onclick="setGameMode('4choice')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all bg-popYellow border-2 border-popDarkBlue shadow-sm text-popDarkBlue">
                            4<ruby>択<rt>たく</rt></ruby>クイズ
                        </button>
                        <button id="mode-all" onclick="setGameMode('all')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            <span id="all-lock-icon">🔒</span> ぜんぶ(A-Z)
                        </button>
                        <button id="mode-cards" onclick="openCardsModeDirectly()" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80">
                            ずかん
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Time Select -->
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-popDarkBlue mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-hourglass-half mr-1 text-popPurple"></i> じかん</label>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 bg-sky-100/70 p-1.5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-popDarkBlue">
                        <button id="time-180" onclick="setTimeMode(180)" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all bg-popPurple text-white border-2 border-popDarkBlue shadow-sm">
                            3<ruby>分<rt>ふん</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="time-300" onclick="setTimeMode(300)" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80">
                            5<ruby>分<rt>ふん</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="time-unlimited" onclick="setTimeMode('unlimited')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80">
                            <ruby>無制限<rt>むせいげん</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Game Select Buttons -->
                <div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
                        <label class="block text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-popDarkBlue"><i class="fa-solid fa-font mr-1 text-popGreen"></i> ゲーム セレクト</label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 bg-sky-100/70 p-1.5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-popDarkBlue max-h-52 overflow-y-auto">
                        <button id="case-upper" onclick="setLetterCase('upper')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all bg-popBlue text-white border-2 border-popDarkBlue shadow-sm">
                            アルファベット <ruby>大文字<rt>おおもじ</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-lower" onclick="setLetterCase('lower')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80">
                            アルファベット <ruby>小文字<rt>こもじ</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-mix" onclick="setLetterCase('mix')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            <span id="mix-lock-icon">🔒</span> <ruby>大文字<rt>おおもじ</rt></ruby>と<ruby>小文字<rt>こもじ</rt></ruby> ミックス
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-color" onclick="setLetterCase('color')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            🎨 <ruby>色<rt>いろ</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-animal" onclick="setLetterCase('animal')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            🐶 <ruby>動物<rt>どうぶつ</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-number" onclick="setLetterCase('number')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            🔢 <ruby>数<rt>かず</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-day" onclick="setLetterCase('day')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            📅 <ruby>曜日<rt>ようび</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-month" onclick="setLetterCase('month')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            🗓️ 1<ruby>月<rt>がつ</rt></ruby>～12<ruby>月<rt>がつ</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-daily" onclick="setLetterCase('daily')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            🏠 <ruby>日用品<rt>にちようひん</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-vegfruit" onclick="setLetterCase('vegfruit')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            🥦 <ruby>野菜<rt>やさい</rt></ruby>・くだもの
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-dish" onclick="setLetterCase('dish')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            🍳 <ruby>料理名<rt>りょうりめい</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-sports" onclick="setLetterCase('sports')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            ⚽ スポーツ
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-building" onclick="setLetterCase('building')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            🏢 <ruby>施設<rt>しせつ</rt></ruby>・たてもの
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-verb" onclick="setLetterCase('verb')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            🏃 <ruby>動詞<rt>どうし</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-adjective" onclick="setLetterCase('adjective')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            😊 <ruby>形容詞<rt>けいようし</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-country" onclick="setLetterCase('country')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            🌍 <ruby>国<rt>くに</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-vehicle" onclick="setLetterCase('vehicle')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            🚗 <ruby>乗り物<rt>のりもの</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-stationery" onclick="setLetterCase('stationery')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            ✏️ <ruby>文房具<rt>ぶんぼうぐ</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                        <button id="case-subject" onclick="setLetterCase('subject')" class="py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm transition-all text-popDarkBlue hover:bg-white/80 flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
                            📚 <ruby>教科名<rt>きょうかめい</rt></ruby>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Start Button -->
            <button onclick="startGame()" class="w-full mt-2 bg-popGreen hover:bg-emerald-400 text-white font-black border-4 border-popDarkBlue rounded-2xl py-4 text-2xl md:text-3xl card-shadow btn-push flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> スタート！
            </button>
        </div>

        <div id="game-screen" class="hidden w-full flex flex-col items-center">
            
            <!-- Game Top Bar -->
            <div class="w-full max-w-2xl flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-6 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur px-4 py-2 rounded-2xl border-3 border-popDarkBlue shadow-sm">
                <button onclick="goToStartScreen()" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-gray-200 hover:bg-gray-300 text-popDarkBlue font-bold text-xs md:text-sm border-2 border-popDarkBlue flex items-center gap-1">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i> <ruby>設定<rt>せってい</rt></ruby>にもどる
                </button>

                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs md:text-sm font-bold">
                    <span class="text-gray-600 hidden sm:inline"><i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high"></i> はやさ:</span>
                    <button id="speed-slow" onclick="setSpeechRate(0.7)" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-popDarkBlue font-bold border border-popDarkBlue/30">ゆっくり</button>
                    <button id="speed-normal" onclick="setSpeechRate(1.0)" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-popGreen text-white font-bold border border-popDarkBlue/30">ふつう</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="quiz-container" class="w-full flex flex-col items-center">
                <!-- Audio Replay Card / Speaker Button -->
                <div class="relative mb-8 text-center">
                    <div id="speaker-btn" onclick="playCurrentTargetSound()" class="cursor-pointer bg-gradient-to-tr from-popYellow to-amber-300 border-4 border-popDarkBlue w-32 h-32 md:w-40 md:h-40 rounded-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center shadow-xl hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-transform animate-pulseGlow mx-auto group">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-volume-high text-5xl md:text-6xl text-popDarkBlue group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"></i>
                        <span class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-popDarkBlue mt-2 bg-white/70 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full">もういちど <ruby>聞<rt>き</rt></ruby>く</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Speech Bubble Hint -->
                    <div id="hint-bubble" class="hidden mt-4 bg-white border-3 border-popDarkBlue px-6 py-2 rounded-2xl shadow-md inline-flex items-center gap-3 animate-popIn">
                        <span id="hint-emoji" class="text-3xl">🍎</span>
                        <div class="text-left">
                            <p id="hint-word" class="font-alphabet text-lg font-bold text-popDarkBlue">Apple</p>
                            <p id="hint-text" class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-bold">「A」からはじまる<ruby>単語<rt>たんご</rt></ruby></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Choice Options Grid (4-choice mode) -->
                <div id="choices-grid" class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-6 w-full max-w-2xl">
                    <!-- Injected by JS -->
                </div>

                <!-- Grid Mode (All Grid) -->
                <div id="all-grid" class="hidden grid grid-cols-4 sm:grid-cols-6 md:grid-cols-7 gap-2 md:gap-3 w-full max-w-3xl">
                    <!-- Injected by JS -->
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Picture Book Mode Container -->
            <div id="cards-container" class="hidden w-full max-w-5xl">
                <p class="text-center font-bold text-popDarkBlue mb-3 text-xs md:text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-pointer"></i> カードをおすと <ruby>発音<rt>はつおん</rt></ruby>と<ruby>単語<rt>たんご</rt></ruby>が<ruby>聞<rt>き</rt></ruby>けるよ！</p>
                
                <!-- Category Filter Tabs -->
                <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mb-6">
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('all')" id="card-tab-all" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-popYellow border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue shadow-sm transition-all">ぜんぶ</button>
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('alphabet')" id="card-tab-alphabet" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue transition-all">🔤 アルファベット</button>
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('color')" id="card-tab-color" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue transition-all">🎨 <ruby>色<rt>いろ</rt></ruby></button>
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('animal')" id="card-tab-animal" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue transition-all">🐶 <ruby>動物<rt>どうぶつ</rt></ruby></button>
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('number')" id="card-tab-number" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue transition-all">🔢 <ruby>数<rt>かず</rt></ruby></button>
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('day')" id="card-tab-day" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue transition-all">📅 <ruby>曜日<rt>ようび</rt></ruby></button>
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('month')" id="card-tab-month" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue transition-all">🗓 1<ruby>月<rt>がつ</rt></ruby>～12<ruby>月<rt>がつ</rt></ruby></button>
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('daily')" id="card-tab-daily" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue transition-all">🏠 <ruby>日用品<rt>にちようひん</rt></ruby></button>
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('vegfruit')" id="card-tab-vegfruit" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue transition-all">🥦 <ruby>野菜<rt>やさい</rt></ruby>・くだもの</button>
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('dish')" id="card-tab-dish" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue transition-all">🍳 <ruby>料理名<rt>りょうりめい</rt></ruby></button>
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('sports')" id="card-tab-sports" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue transition-all">⚽ スポーツ</button>
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('building')" id="card-tab-building" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue transition-all">🏢 <ruby>施設<rt>しせつ</rt></ruby>・たてもの</button>
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('verb')" id="card-tab-verb" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue transition-all">🏃 <ruby>動詞<rt>どうし</rt></ruby></button>
                    <button onclick="filterCardsCategory('adjective')" id="card-tab-adjective" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs md:text-sm bg-white hover:bg-sky-50 border-2 border-popDarkBlue text-popDarkBlue transition-all">😊 <ruby>形容詞<rt>けいようし</rt></ruby></button>
